WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.114
In tutorial 1.1, you'll
create your Alaventra account.

00:00:10.164 --> 00:00:11.436
It takes about a minute.

00:00:12.457 --> 00:00:15.874
First, go to alaventra.com
and click Start free.

00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:20.111
Now click Sign up with Google,

00:00:20.161 --> 00:00:23.410
or type your name and the work
e-mail you'll sign in with.

00:00:26.411 --> 00:00:29.061
Then choose a password with
at least 10 characters,

00:00:29.111 --> 00:00:31.474
using letters and numbers or symbols.

00:00:33.407 --> 00:00:37.007
Under the button, we say we'll
send a link to confirm your e-mail.

00:00:37.057 --> 00:00:38.708
Now click Create account.

00:00:40.886 --> 00:00:45.686
When the e-mail arrives, open the link,
and you'll see Your e-mail is confirmed.

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:47.424
Click Continue to carry on.

00:00:48.418 --> 00:00:50.893
You're on the first step
of your company setup.

00:00:50.943 --> 00:00:55.401
The steps on the left show it all, and
your progress is saved after each one.

00:00:56.443 --> 00:01:01.723
So, open the sign-up page, sign up with
Google or e-mail, confirm your e-mail,

00:01:01.773 --> 00:01:03.310
and continue into the setup.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:09.163
Your account is ready. Next, set
up your company in tutorial 1.2.
